<title>USA: Luby's Cafeterias Q1 shr falls to $0.35.</title>
<headline>Luby's Cafeterias Q1 shr falls to $0.35.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ended Nov. 30</p>
<p>						   1996		  1995</p>
<p>				 (In thousands except per share data)</p>
<p> Sales				     $122,287	    $108,337</p>
<p> Net income				   8,166		 8,565</p>
<p> Net income per share			 .35		   .37</p>
<p>Average number of shares outstanding</p>
<p>						 23,614		23,322</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q1 includes preopening expenses of $0.045 a share.</p>
<p>Company acquired 15 former Wyatt's locations in September 1996.</p>
<p>The company operates 222 cafeterias.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
